<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4837" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>capture,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.156
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				589
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐων ἅ.</span>
			<i>conquest</i> by enemy, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				119
			</span></i>: <i>means of conquest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				61
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>taking, catching</i> of birds and fish, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				593a20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				600a3
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαλωκότες ἰσχυρὰν
			ἅλωσιν</span> taken <i>without power to escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> law-term,
				<i>conviction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				920a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				97.3
			</span></i>.</div>
